  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 8 + j) = 6400171 + 8 * j by omega]
    exact good_of_checkDown check_8 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 9 + j) = 7200171 + 8 * j by omega]
    exact good_of_checkDown check_9 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 10 + j) = 8000171 + 8 * j by omega]
    exact good_of_checkDown check_10 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 11 + j) = 8800171 + 8 * j by omega]
