    exact good_of_checkDown check_14 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 15 + j) = 12000171 + 8 * j by omega]
    exact good_of_checkDown check_15 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 16 + j) = 12800171 + 8 * j by omega]
    exact good_of_checkDown check_16 hj
  · rw [show 171 + 8 * (100000 * 17 + j) = 13600171 + 8 * j by omega]
